<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιορ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marking out by
			boundaries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				16
			</span></i> ; <i>description of the boundaries</i> of a property, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				225.31
			</span></i> (Didyma, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				685.57
			</span></i> (Crete, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>, pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.
				τῆς οἰκουμένης</span>
			<i>description</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Scymn.
				74
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>boundary</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Geom.</u>
				4.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in Metric,
				<i>division</i> of a strophe, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ περιορισμοὺς ἀνίσους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heph.
				</span></i>
			<i>Poëm.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρύφακτοι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				228.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Law-term,
				= Lat. <i>deportatio</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
